d be grown. Write down the estimate of the region-weighted mean\nyield of V1 and its standard error, and do the same for the\nregion-weighted difference between V1 and V3. Compute them with the\nlisting. Which of the three kinds of marginal mean in this section would\nyou report to a grower in the region?</p>","file":"ch17-unbalanced-data/01-cell-means.html"}